# 原紙箱 and 原紙集め (design 11.2.2, 11.2.3), for tools/ui_run.py. The system's
# 原紙箱 (its window at 893,35, its work area from 903,64, the links from 8,8 of
# it, 27 apart) is an ordinary box of links to the templates: its own template
# is in it, and carried into the BTRON window it makes a new, empty 原紙箱. An
# application deleted takes its template's link out of the system's 原紙箱, and
# registered again puts it back. 原紙集め (its work area from 670,69, the links
# laid out as in the 原紙箱) lists every template. The link of 空書庫 taken out
# of the 原紙箱 leaves the template, and carried from 原紙集め into the 原紙箱 a
# new object made from it is put there. A text put into the 原紙箱 is a template
# of the person's (ユーザ原紙): carried out, a copy is made and the text stays as
# it was.
waitwin 原紙箱
# the 原紙箱 in front of the text TADjsについて, which lies over it
click 1000 48
wait 300
shot bb_front
# its own template carried into the BTRON window: a new 原紙箱
linkdrag 原紙箱 原紙箱 250 60
wait 1000
key 28
expect desktop: 原紙箱 made from the template 原紙箱
wait 800
# opened: an empty 原紙箱 of its own, closed again (Ctrl+E)
dclick 250 60
wait 1500
shot bb_new
key 08 01
wait 800
# MPEG Player deleted: its template's link out of the system's 原紙箱; registered again: back
progrm 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok 0
expect template 0 of mpeg-player taken out of the 原紙箱 (0)
proginst 01a0f638-4c5a-78a9-9bbd-adfbafa3466a
want ok 0
expect template 0 of mpeg-player linked from the 原紙箱 (0)
wait 800
shot bb_reinst
# 空書庫 (the 12th link, at 911,369) chosen and taken out of the 原紙箱
click 1000 48
wait 300
click 940 378
wait 300
key 4C
wait 800
shot bb_deleted
# 原紙集め from its program object: every template of the applications
open 01a0d8c4-5b92-7c53-8d64-9fab0c1d5b92
waitwin 原紙集め
expect basecol: up
expect basecol: 16 templates
wait 1000
shot bb_collect
# 空書庫 (the 12th row, at 678,374) carried from 原紙集め into the 原紙箱, under its links
drag 700 383 990 600
wait 1000
key 28
expect desktop: template carried, made from it: 0
expect basecol: carried 空書庫 (0)
wait 800
shot bb_back
# the text 実身/仮身 put into the 原紙箱 (its link carried there out of the text
# TADjsについて, at 315,323), and carried out into that text again: a copy is made, the
# text stays as it was (the BTRON window is sealed: nothing is carried out of it or into it)
sum 019a6c9b-e67e-7a35-a461-0d199550e4cf
keep text
# the text's window moved 140 left and 100 down, off the 原紙箱's links
drag 500 148 360 248
wait 800
drag 175 423 1000 560
wait 800
shot bb_user
linkdrag 原紙箱 実身/仮身 400 600
wait 1000
key 28
expect desktop: 実身/仮身 made from the template 実身/仮身
wait 800
sum 019a6c9b-e67e-7a35-a461-0d199550e4cf
same text
shot bb_user_out
absent !OACV!
